{"id":23385,"section":"officeHoldings","title":"Laurene Weste — City Council Member, The City of Santa Clarita","status":"live","uri":null,"holdingPerson":["#15929 Laurene Weste"],"holdingOffice":["#18327 City Council Member"],"holdingBody":["#394 The City of Santa Clarita"],"termStart":"December 2022","termStartEdtf":"2022-12","selectionMethod":"elected","howEnded":"serving","startEvidence":"roster","footnotes":[{"col1":"1","col2":"Elected on November 8, 2022, first of 9 candidates for 3 seats, with 32,886 votes.","col3":"editorial-2026","number":"1","note":"Elected on November 8, 2022, first of 9 candidates for 3 seats, with 32,886 votes.","source":"editorial-2026"},{"col1":"2","col2":"No declaring document is held: the outcome rests on the count and on CEDA, the state's compilation of local results, which marks the same winner. California Elections Data Archive (CEDA), Center for California Studies and Institute for Social Research, California State University, Sacramento, with the Secretary of State: the 2022 candidates file (CEDA2022Data.xlsx), a compilation of the counties' returns, not a certified return.","col3":"editorial-2026","number":"2","note":"No declaring document is held: the outcome rests on the count and on CEDA, the state's compilation of local results, which marks the same winner. California Elections Data Archive (CEDA), Center for California Studies and Institute for Social Research, California State University, Sacramento, with the Secretary of State: the 2022 candidates file (CEDA2022Data.xlsx), a compilation of the counties' returns, not a certified return.","source":"editorial-2026"}],"editorNotes":[{"col1":null,"col2":null,"col3":null,"heading":null,"note":null,"position":null}],"recordProvenance":"council_winners_and_terms.php, 29 September 2026","recordDates":[{"col1":null,"col2":null,"col3":null,"col4":null,"col5":null,"printed":null,"iso":null,"granularity":null,"label":null,"confirmed":null,"col6":null,"rejected":null}]}
{"id":23383,"section":"officeHoldings","title":"Laurene Weste — City Council Member, The City of Santa Clarita","status":"live","uri":null,"holdingPerson":["#15929 Laurene Weste"],"holdingOffice":["#18327 City Council Member"],"holdingBody":["#394 The City of Santa Clarita"],"termStart":"December 2018","termStartEdtf":"2018-12","termEnd":"December 2022","termEndEdtf":"2022-12","selectionMethod":"elected","howEnded":"reelected","startEvidence":"roster","endEvidence":"derived","footnotes":[{"col1":"1","col2":"Elected on November 6, 2018, first of 15 candidates for 3 seats, with 25,603 votes.","col3":"editorial-2026","number":"1","note":"Elected on November 6, 2018, first of 15 candidates for 3 seats, with 25,603 votes.","source":"editorial-2026"},{"col1":"2","col2":"The roster gives Laurene Weste 1998—. Leon Worden, \"Santa Clarita City Council 1987—\", the council ledger on SCVHistory.com, carried on the page for LW3149 (archive record #4967).","col3":"editorial-2026","number":"2","note":"The roster gives Laurene Weste 1998—. Leon Worden, \"Santa Clarita City Council 1987—\", the council ledger on SCVHistory.com, carried on the page for LW3149 (archive record #4967).","source":"editorial-2026"},{"col1":"3","col2":"The term's end is derived: the seat was next filled at the election of November 8, 2022. Terms turn over in December: Cameron Smyth left the council on 10 December 2024.","col3":"editorial-2026","number":"3","note":"The term's end is derived: the seat was next filled at the election of November 8, 2022. Terms turn over in December: Cameron Smyth left the council on 10 December 2024.","source":"editorial-2026"}],"editorNotes":[{"col1":null,"col2":null,"col3":null,"heading":null,"note":null,"position":null}],"recordProvenance":"council_winners_and_terms.php, 29 September 2026","recordDates":[{"col1":null,"col2":null,"col3":null,"col4":null,"col5":null,"printed":null,"iso":null,"granularity":null,"label":null,"confirmed":null,"col6":null,"rejected":null}]}
